<section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-header__title">{{Page.Title}}</h1>
    <p class="page-header__description">End-to-end IT services for retail stores, restaurants, and hospitality businesses.</p>
</section>

<section class="services">
    <div class="services__grid">
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">POS Setup &amp; Support</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">Complete point-of-sale system deployment, configuration, and ongoing support. We work with all major POS platforms to ensure reliable transactions.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Hardware procurement and setup</li>
                <li>Software configuration</li>
                <li>Payment processing integration</li>
                <li>Staff training</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">Wi-Fi Management</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">Enterprise-grade wireless networks with separate guest and business segments, captive portals, and analytics.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Site surveys and design</li>
                <li>Guest network with branding</li>
                <li>Bandwidth management</li>
                <li>Usage analytics</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">Security Cameras</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">IP camera systems with remote viewing, motion detection, and integration with your existing security infrastructure.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Camera placement planning</li>
                <li>HD and 4K systems</li>
                <li>Cloud and local storage</li>
                <li>Mobile viewing apps</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">Inventory IT</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">Technology infrastructure for inventory management including barcode systems, RFID, and integration with your supply chain.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Barcode and RFID systems</li>
                <li>Real-time tracking</li>
                <li>Multi-location sync</li>
                <li>Reporting and analytics</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">Network Infrastructure</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">Reliable, secure networking designed for high-traffic retail environments with PCI compliance in mind.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Structured cabling</li>
                <li>Firewall and security</li>
                <li>PCI-compliant segmentation</li>
                <li>Redundant connectivity</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="services__card">
            <h3 class="services__card-title">Help Desk</h3>
            <p class="services__card-text">Dedicated support for your retail team with fast response times and retail-specific expertise.</p>
            <ul class="services__card-features">
                <li>Phone, email, and chat support</li>
                <li>Remote troubleshooting</li>
                <li>On-site dispatch</li>
                <li>Escalation management</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{{#if Site.EnabledIntegrations}}
<section class="integrations">
    <h2 class="integrations__title">Technology Partners</h2>
    <div class="integrations__list">
        {{#each Site.EnabledIntegrations}}
            {{> IntegrationLink}}
        {{/each}}
    </div>
</section>
{{/if}}

<section class="cta">
    <div class="cta__content">
        <h2 class="cta__title">Ready to Modernize?</h2>
        <p class="cta__text">Contact {{Site.CompanyName}} for a free retail technology assessment.</p>
        <a href="/{{Site.CompanySlug}}/contact" class="cta__button">Request a Consultation</a>
    </div>
</section>
